# Pipeline — {{PROJECT_NAME}} · Proposals

Status moves forward as the proposal is sent and the contact responds. A rejected or expired proposal stays that way — draft a new one rather than reviving it.

| Status | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| Draft | Being drafted; not yet sent to the contact |
| Sent | Delivered to the contact; awaiting a response |
| Approved | Contact approved — `mark-approved` has minted every item's hash |
| Rejected | Contact declined |
| Expired | `Valid Until` passed with no response |

